438-719a-5234-978d-6979ac003590" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111291 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186109471 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111291 #edb/ref 1069 "q-53299" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111291 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/1d/1d66d31fed706f880a9795b54111d66498151f9b4406b6d7a48e11dfff3a1eeb.png)\n\nFor which value of $t$ is the rectangle above also a square?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111291 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "3b8f0d65-4e71-5ab1-a60d-763912ae5001" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111292 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186109477 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111292 #edb/ref 1069 "q-53300" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111292 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/5b/5b2ade26c577b7362460f55397024e3b321a54d769fe1c412f79f38b17f40806.png)\n\nIn a square above, $PO = 5mm$. Find $QS$." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111292 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "edf030ed-b6b9-5315-a9c6-c9ad7d40039b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111429 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186111773 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111429 #edb/ref 1061 10171 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111429 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "11275c8d-5eda-5537-b710-43e9d7986214" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111429 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186111858 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111770 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186111771 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111770 #edb/ref 1061 9475 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111770 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "337c70d4-a057-5cca-a1b3-1b562ca18243" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111770 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186111848 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111771 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186111772 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111771 #edb/ref 1061 9477 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111771 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d1cc100b-1e40-5423-9063-33792faf9ba3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111771 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186110780 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111772 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186111429 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111772 #edb/ref 1061 9480 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111772 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "e9d3b922-be32-5148-9777-69106a03603f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111772 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186110781 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111773 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186111774 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111773 #edb/ref 1061 9482 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111773 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "bdf53605-b19b-5cf7-8ba7-50a6b1345a67" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111773 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186110782 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111774 #edb/ref 1061 9486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111774 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d10125a1-a3c4-5723-8b84-ca4ef525a806" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111774 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186110783 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111848 #edb/ref 1064 "A **rectangle** is a parallelogram where all angles are right. It has all the properties of parallelograms: its opposite sides are parallel and congruent.\n\n![](images/1f/1fa96b5993a48483798ff4ac05d75f1ffa271f82e5ed6e61a452eb97b3daf3e4.png)\n\nIf all $4$ sides of a rectangle are congruent, then it is a **square**.\n\n![](images/82/822788813f0e81eebef50f324e1bcaf329e7fa5552e10557a19d20b4e868063e.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111848 #edb/ref 1065 2270 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111848 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "1fb26940-464f-55d2-9903-b4695c595b5f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111848 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111858 #edb/ref 1064 "The diagonals of a rectangle are equal and bisect each other. Consequently, they divide a rectangle into four isosceles triangles, as shown below.\n\n![](images/4f/4f0aafdf04bb7f967122fc8f90454b1b09787e375857bac3bcf5fdf80925e32c.png)\n\nIn a square, the diagonals also bisect the angles.\n\n![](images/cd/cd61fabe993fa6cde5ea4020a659e86b3543597d70a304b3e5ada3abfa426186.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111858 #edb/ref 1065 2357 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111858 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "4643230c-067e-5817-af66-88717e7b8c66" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111858 #edb/ref 1067 "The Diagonals of Rectangles and Squares" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
